    dcterms:description "Task: Build and optimize a secure web page for evolving business needs using a variety of appropriate programming languages. Competency statement: Evaluate potential security hazards and apply optimization techniques. Required knowledge: AR-Performance-Energy, NC-Security, OS-Protection, SF-Security, SE-Design, SE-Tools, SPD-Common, SPD-Mobile, SEP-Privacy. Required skills: Develop. Desirable professional dispositions: Adaptable, Meticulous, Proactive, Responsible."@en ;
